#### With a Zod schema (runtime validation)

```typescript
import { z } from "zod";

const UserSchema = z.object({
  id:        z.string().uuid(),
  name:      z.string().min(1).max(100),
  email:     z.string().email(),
  avatarUrl: z.string().url().optional(),
});

