### Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| `isPlainObject` prototype check | Rejects class instances, arrays, `null` |
| Flexible `timestamp` input | Accepts `Date`, ISO string, or Unix ms for real-world flexibility |
| `payload` defaults to `{}` | Events without data are common (e.g. heartbeats) |
| `EventParseError` with `field` | Structured errors are easier to catch and log |
| `parseEventAs` generic overload | Keeps the base parser simple while enabling full type safety |

