### Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| `JsonObject` payload type | Fully typed recursive JSON — no `any` |
| `Date` as `timestamp` type | Normalises strings/numbers into a real `Date` |
| `EventParseError` with `field` | Precise, machine-readable error location |
| Missing `payload` → `{}` | Payload is optional; avoids unnecessary throws |
| `assertPlainObject` type guard | Reusable narrowing with an `asserts` signature |

