### Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| Generic `<T>` return type | Allows callers to type the resolved value |
| `BodyInit \| null` for body | Matches the native Fetch API body type |
| Content-Type based parsing | Automatically handles JSON, text, and binary responses |
| `GET`/`HEAD` body guard | Prevents semantically invalid requests |
| `response.ok` check | Throws on 4xx/5xx instead of silently failing |

