### Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| Generic `<T>` return type | Lets callers type the response without casting |
| Auto JSON serialization | Plain objects are stringified and `Content-Type` is set automatically |
| `FormData`/`Blob`/etc. passthrough | Native `BodyInit` types are forwarded unchanged |
